    "<h3 id=\"p40017001_01-1\">Synthetic Heading One</h3>\n<p id=\"p40017001_01-1\" class=\"starts-chapter\"><b class=\"chapter-num\" id=\"v40017001-1\">17:1&nbsp;</b>Placeholder words of verse one. <b class=\"verse-num\" id=\"v40017002-1\">2&nbsp;</b>Placeholder words of verse two<sup class=\"footnote\"><a class=\"fn\" href=\"#f1-\">1</a></sup> continue here.</p>\n<p id=\"p40017003_01-1\"><b class=\"verse-num\" id=\"v40017003-1\">3&nbsp;</b>Verse three starts a paragraph.</p>\n<p class=\"block-indent\"><span class=\"begin-line-group\"></span>\n<span id=\"p40017004_01-1\" class=\"line\"><b class=\"verse-num\" id=\"v40017004-1\">4&nbsp;</b>Verse four first line,</span><br /><span id=\"p40017004_01-1\" class=\"indent line\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;indented second line of verse four.</span><br />\n<span id=\"p40017005_01-1\" class=\"indent line\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<b class=\"verse-num\" id=\"v40017005-1\">5&nbsp;</b>Verse five on an indented line.</span><br /><span class=\"end-line-group\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"p40017020_01-1\">Synthetic Heading Two</h3>\n<p id=\"p40017020_01-1\"><b class=\"verse-num\" id=\"v40017020-1\">20&nbsp;</b>Verse twenty ends the paragraph.<sup class=\"footnote\"><a class=\"fn\" href=\"#f2-\">2</a></sup></p>\n<p id=\"p40017022_01-1\"><b class=\"verse-num\" id=\"v40017022-1\">22&nbsp;</b>Verse twenty-two follows a verse that is left out, with <span class=\"divine-name\">Lord</span> in small caps.</p>\n"
  ]
